OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for cocaine
OL,4,Ause
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer has been sacked for
OL,7,Fgross misconduct after a drugs test
OL,8,Fshowed he had cocaine in his system.
OL,10,FSpecial Constable Samuel Toynbee told a
OL,11,FLincolnshire Police disciplinary panel
OL,12,Fhe "never has and never will take
OL,13,Fcocaine" and said the results must have
OL,14,Fbeen from "coming into contact with
OL,15,Fdrug users and dealers on a daily
OL,16,Fbasis".
OL,18,FIndependent toxicologist Kirsty Watson
OL,19,Ftold the hearing she believed
OL,20,F"ingestion was more likely than
OL,21,Fexposure" due to the levels.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
