OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for cocaine
OL,4,Ause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel ruled Toynbee's actions
OL,7,Famounted to discreditable conduct and
OL,8,Fhe was dismissed from the special
OL,9,Fconstabulary without notice.
